@startuml Sequence_PlanMeeting
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title Planification d'une Réunion (Admin)

actor Admin
participant "DashboardActivity" as Dashboard
participant "ReunionActivity" as ReunionList
participant "ReunionEditActivity" as ReunionEdit
participant "AppDatabase" as DB
participant "ReunionDao" as ReunionDao
participant "ReunionParticipantDao" as ParticipantDao
participant "UserDao" as UserDao

Admin -> Dashboard: Cliquer sur "Planifier une réunion"
Dashboard -> ReunionList: Naviguer avec USER_ID
activate ReunionList

ReunionList -> DB: getDatabase()
activate DB
ReunionList -> ReunionDao: getAllReunions()
ReunionDao --> ReunionList: List<Reunion>
ReunionList -> UserDao: getAllUsers()
UserDao --> ReunionList: List<User>
deactivate DB

ReunionList -> Admin: Afficher liste des réunions
Admin -> ReunionList: Cliquer sur "Planifier une réunion"
ReunionList -> ReunionEdit: Naviguer avec USER_ID
deactivate ReunionList
activate ReunionEdit

ReunionEdit -> DB: getDatabase()
activate DB
ReunionEdit -> UserDao: getAllUsers()
UserDao --> ReunionEdit: List<User> (participants potentiels)
deactivate DB

ReunionEdit -> Admin: Afficher formulaire
Admin -> ReunionEdit: Saisir titre
Admin -> ReunionEdit: Sélectionner date (DatePicker)
Admin -> ReunionEdit: Sélectionner heure (TimePicker)
Admin -> ReunionEdit: Saisir ordre du jour
Admin -> ReunionEdit: Sélectionner participants (checkboxes)
Admin -> ReunionEdit: Cliquer sur "Enregistrer"

ReunionEdit -> ReunionEdit: Valider les champs
ReunionEdit -> DB: getDatabase()
activate DB
ReunionEdit -> ReunionDao: insert(Reunion)
ReunionDao --> ReunionEdit: reunionId

loop Pour chaque participant sélectionné
  ReunionEdit -> ParticipantDao: insert(ReunionParticipant)
  ParticipantDao --> ReunionEdit: Success
end
deactivate DB
ReunionEdit -> Admin: Afficher message de succès
ReunionEdit -> ReunionList: Retour à la liste
deactivate ReunionEdit
activate ReunionList
ReunionList -> ReunionDao: getAllReunions()
ReunionDao --> ReunionList: List<Reunion> (mis à jour)
ReunionList -> Admin: Afficher liste mise à jour
deactivate ReunionList
@enduml
